'''Matriarch's Perfume''' is a {{Special}} item that resets [[The Matriarch]]'s cooldown.

== Obtaining ==
'''Matriarch's Perfume''' can be obtained from the [[Bits Shop]] for {{Bits|1200}}.

== Usage ==
Once {{Item|Heavy Pearl|amount=3}}s have been collected from [[The Matriarch]], '''Matriarch's Perfume''' can be consumed to make it produce {{Green|3}} more. This can be done up to 4 times a day, meaning a total of {{Item|Heavy Pearl|amount=15}}s can be obtained per day, or a total of {{Item|Heavy Pearl|amount=18}}s if the {{Attr|Matriarch Cubs}} attribute procs every time.

