== Tips ==
*When the pearls are sold on [[Bazaar]], this effectively grants {{BZC|{{#expr:3 / 1200}} Heavy Pearl}} per {{bits|alt=Bit}} spent or {{BZC|{{#expr:3 / 1200 * 6 / 5}} Heavy Pearl}} per {{bits|alt=Bit}} spent with {{Attr|Matriarch Cubs X}}, which is ineffective, making this item only viable for {{Gamemode|ironman}} players.

